    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, a sealed domain was crafted for warriors to battle endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In search of a way to prolong your master's life, you venture into this unknown realm. But to leave, you must face those who came before you.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Duels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a series of unique opponents in intense fast-paced duels. Each boss brings their own distinct abilities and attacks for you to overcome.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/19d0de2f2c95402be337818c3fe50da6.poster.avif?t=1755243306\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/19d0de2f2c95402be337818c3fe50da6.webm?t=1755243306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/19d0de2f2c95402be337818c3fe50da6.mp4?t=1755243306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deflect, dodge, or even use your own attacks to parry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All abilities are available right from the start\u00a0\u2014 your success depends only on how you use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/163e5ff54878032e7cd818bcd4e0ced9.poster.avif?t=1755243306\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/163e5ff54878032e7cd818bcd4e0ced9.webm?t=1755243306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/163e5ff54878032e7cd818bcd4e0ced9.mp4?t=1755243306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Hidden Truths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss has a story. Learn as much\u00a0\u2014 or as little\u00a0\u2014 as you choose.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/4fb2aec4214c5fb795069b3ad806be99.poster.avif?t=1755243306\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/4fb2aec4214c5fb795069b3ad806be99.webm?t=1755243306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/4fb2aec4214c5fb795069b3ad806be99.mp4?t=1755243306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Allies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a realm where death can be endlessly deferred, some defeated foes may return in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/52f8eb40b80bc279ff801d303d32f463.poster.avif?t=1755243306\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/52f8eb40b80bc279ff801d303d32f463.webm?t=1755243306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/52f8eb40b80bc279ff801d303d32f463.mp4?t=1755243306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear storyline with fast-paced action combat duels against multiple bosses.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly blend offense and defense with dodges, parries, and counter-attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All abilities are available from the start for you to play with.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional character stories and interactions enrich the world without interrupting gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
